  "hints": [
    {
      "title": "Track the power of the whole term",
      "body": "<p>If you choose the reciprocal term from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow></math> brackets, how many brackets contribute <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow></math>? Add all the resulting exponents.</p>",
      "recap": "Find the exponent before evaluating a coefficient.",
      "pitfall": "A constant term has total exponent zero; it need not come from choosing constants.",
      "pause": "Write the total exponent in terms of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow></math>.",
      "recall": [
        {
          "lessonId": "p2-b2-l05",
          "reminder": "Find the exponent before evaluating a coefficient."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Count the selections and retain the sign",
      "body": "<p>Set your exponent equal to zero and solve for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow></math>. There are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo minsize=\"2.047em\" maxsize=\"2.047em\">&#x00028;</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0\"><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo minsize=\"2.047em\" maxsize=\"2.047em\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></math> ways to select those brackets, and every reciprocal choice contributes a minus sign.</p>",
      "recap": "Binomial terms need both a selection count and the sign of each chosen factor.",
      "pitfall": "A positive combination count does not make every coefficient positive.",
      "pause": "Find the allowed integer <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow></math>, then calculate the signed coefficient.",
      "recall": [
        {
          "lessonId": "p1-b2-l03",
          "reminder": "Binomial terms need both a selection count and the sign of each chosen factor."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "solution": "<p>Choose <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo>&#x02212;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></math> from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow></math> of the twelve brackets and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow></math> from the other <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></math>. The term is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo minsize=\"2.047em\" maxsize=\"2.047em\">&#x00028;</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0\"><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo minsize=\"2.047em\" maxsize=\"2.047em\">&#x00029;</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mi>k</mi></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></math>.</p><p>A constant requires <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>72</mn><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>, hence <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></math>. The coefficient is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mo minsize=\"2.047em\" maxsize=\"2.047em\">&#x00028;</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0\"><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo minsize=\"2.047em\" maxsize=\"2.047em\">&#x00029;</mo><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mo minsize=\"2.047em\" maxsize=\"2.047em\">&#x00028;</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0\"><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo minsize=\"2.047em\" maxsize=\"2.047em\">&#x00029;</mo><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>220</mn></mrow></math>. <strong>Answer B.</strong></p>",
